# Flutter mobile app

Path: `frontend/mobile`. Package: `circular_salone`. Display name: **Circular Salone**. Android org: `sl.circularsalone`.

## Folder layout

Follow [docs/architecture/mobile-app.md](docs/architecture/mobile-app.md):

- `lib/main.dart` — bootstrap only; starts `CircularSaloneApp`
- `lib/app/` — theme, navigation, app shell
- `lib/core/` — shared networking, storage, auth client, sync, permissions, utilities
- `lib/features/<feature>/` — each with `presentation/`, `domain/`, `data/`

**presentation** — screens/widgets only; no HTTP/DB. **domain** — use cases; no HTTP/DB/widgets. **data** — API and local storage; no widgets.

Screens must not call the database or build raw HTTP; data layer does.

## Dart style

- Keep types; avoid `dynamic` except at untyped boundaries
- Single quotes; honor `analysis_options.yaml` / `flutter analyze`
- No `print` in committed code (use logging when it exists)
- Comment non-obvious constraints (e.g. unique transaction ids for sync), not obvious code

## Offline and errors

Failed actions must not be reported as successful lifecycle changes. User-facing messages stay plain; technical detail in logs without secrets. Offline failures stay in the sync queue with their transaction id.

## Assets

Register new asset folders in `pubspec.yaml`. Brand logo: `assets/brand/circular_salone_logo.png`.

## Tests

Do not add tests by default. Remove obsolete or scaffold tests under `test/` when finished. CI currently runs `flutter analyze` only.
